  "_doc": "v37 per-robot sound sets (RobotSoundSet). A robot listed here uses its set; others keep the v27 bank profile. impact = authoritative contact speed along the normal (px/s) from the gameplay event; below min = silent; intensity = (impact-min)/(full-min); level = lerp(gain[0], gain[1], intensity). key = shared anti-spam channel: within cooldown a new sound on the same key plays only if it is clearly stronger (+break_through). repeat_duck: same event again within 0.6 s plays quieter (x duck^n, n<=4). families: replaces the v27 profile family of adapter events (launch / rolling / voice) and the charge energy family. All samurai_v37 families are takes split from Assets/Characters/Players/MasterAudio (tools/audio/build_robot_sound_sets.py). v39: all five robots have a set (personality composites in game/assets/audio/v39, built by tools/audio/build_v39_sound_design.py from ElevenLabs sources + MasterAudio). v40 (APK v36.7): charged-landing release = v40/energy_release; charge accumulation = sparse v40/charge_* discharges scheduled in RobotAudioFeedback (no loop).",
